📗
  🏥 The diagnostic app. Its routes report what the server saw and produce
  awkward responses on demand, so tests can check the engine from outside.

    /                      text "ok"
    /inspect[/:value]      GET POST PUT PATCH DELETE: one fact per line
    POST /bytes            the request body, byte for byte
    /stream/:count         that many chunks, streamed
    /status/:code          that status, with the body "body"
    /header?value=…        puts the value in an X-Echo response header
📗
